The accessor is already a single member load, so the only remaining win is to let the compiler fold it into callers within this translation unit; marking it `always_inline` does that without changing its out-of-line symbol or behaviour.

```cpp
__attribute__((always_inline))
std::vector<FieldDefinition>& MesgDefinition::GetFields()
{
    return fields;
}
```
